  "briefing": [
    {"text":"VOICEPACK BRIDGE TEST","size":"large","align":"center"},
    {"text":"Tests the Mission Companion 0.5 in the voice app mode: the mission increments the counters L:CPLAPP5, L:PLTAPP47 ... exactly as the real mission does with the voice code APP, and the program speaks the messages of the pack EN. It also tests the radio rule from the context variables, the sounds without voice, the dispatcher reading a dispatch and the checklist voice."},
    {"text":"Before the test: start HPGMissionCompanion.exe (it sets L:AUDIOINHIBIT to 1 itself) and check in its Voice packs tab that the pack EN is version 2 and that the log says SimConnect: watching N variables. Set the texts to Coherent in the Voice packs tab to hear one option letter in the conversations."},
    {"buttonbar":[{"title":"1 START BRIDGE TEST","commands":[{"call_macro":"vb start"}]},{"title":"STOP","commands":[{"call_macro":"vb stop"}]},{"title":"READ STATUS LVARS","commands":[{"call_macro":"vb status"}]}]},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"local":"vb_status"}],"color":"green"},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"local":"vb_part"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"Report: step 1 voice without radio, step 2 and 3 with radio, last part of step 3 voice; step 4 three different tones; step 5 five lines of the same letter; step 6 the dispatch read without the br tag and with brackets as words, then the briefing; step 7 the checklist voice differs from the pilot; step 8 silence at the reset and a line at the increment. The Voice packs tab shows what the program reads and the last message."}
